"x":185.56163024902344,"width":50,"height":49.074073791503906}},{"url":"?slideid=959D1298-A5B8-4C24-B5BE-E1ED3C341D2E","targetRectangle":{"y":94.230827331542969,"x":185.56163024902344,"width":50,"height":48.84259033203125}}],"accessibility":[{"text":"Have we disagreed? Obviously not; I was talking about me, and you were talking about you; and there’s no inconsistency in one person being hungry while the other is not. ","targetRectangle":{"y":549.36975336074829,"x":301.07736206054688,"width":673.52294921875,"height":96}},{"text":"Consider the following exchange:","targetRectangle":{"y":335.74999940395355,"x":436.75949096679688,"width":341.845703125,"height":32}},{"text":"pasted-image.pdf","targetRectangle":{"y":21.049774169921875,"x":27.092348098754883,"width":139.32150268554688,"height":136.09646606445312}},{"text":"pasted-image.pdf","targetRectangle":{"y":29.134250640869141,"x":185.56163024902344,"width":50,"height":49.074073791503906}},{"text":"Me: I am hungry.","targetRectangle":{"y":424.15987539291382,"x":501.10029602050781,"width":193.1640625,"height":31}},{"text":"You: I am not hungry.","targetRectangle":{"y":448.95987576246262,"x":470.91841125488281,"width":253.52783203125,"height":31}},{"text":"pasted-image.pdf","targetRectangle":{"y":94.230827331542969,"x":185.56163024902344,"width":50,"height":48.84259033203125}},{"text":"As we have seen, one may argue for moral relativism on the basis of moral disagreements between cultures. But, interestingly, one might also argue against moral relativism on the grounds that it cannot give an adequate treatment of the nature of moral disagreement. Indeed, given certain assumptions, it makes moral disagreement between cultures impossible.","targetRectangle":{"y":64.666687965393066,"x":278.17654418945312,"width":690.6005859375,"height":192}}],"baseLayer":{"animations":[],"initialState":{"affineTransform":[1,0,0,1,0,0],"masksToBounds":false,"rotation":0,"scale":1,"position":{"pointX":512,"pointY":384},"width":1024,"sublayer